 "summary": "Thick-film surface-mount current-sense resistors from 10 mΩ to just under 1 Ω (50 mΩ upward in 0402), in eight sizes from 0402 to 2512 and tolerances of ±1%, ±2% and ±5%, with jumpers in 0402 to 1206. Rated power at 70 °C runs from 1/16 W (0402) to 1 W (1218, 2512); 0805 and 1206 also come as double-power grades. Terminations are matte tin over nickel; the parts are RoHS compliant, halogen free and MSL 1. Intended uses named are converters, printers, server boards, telecom and consumer equipment.",
